                 participants wanted more information about why and what to
                 consider. The template for a Plain Language Recommendation is
                 available in the GRADEpro software to facilitate automation.
                 CONCLUSION: We created a Plain Language Recommendation template
                 to communicate specific information from guidelines to patients
                 and the public. Broad application of the template is warranted
