                 - play an important role in health research. They help to
                 highlight issues in the conduct of research with the aim of
                 improving health research methodology, and ultimately reducing
                 research waste. MAIN BODY: We provide an overview of some of
                 the key aspects of methodological studies such as what they
                 are, and when, how and why they are done. We adopt a
