               settings. Details on all reviewed models are publicly available
               at https://www.covprecise.org/. Methodological guidance as
               provided in this paper should be followed because unreliable
               predictions could cause more harm than benefit in guiding
               clinical decisions. Finally, prediction model authors should
               adhere to the TRIPOD (transparent reporting of a multivariable
               prediction model for individual prognosis or diagnosis) reporting
               guideline. SYSTEMATIC REVIEW REGISTRATION: Protocol
